{
  "id": "045",
  "title": "Floor Thirty-Nine",
  "subtitle": "\"Humanity had cleared thirty-eight floors of the Tower in sixty years. Floor Thirty-Nine was where we started losing. I was the first Rank E to clear it solo.\"",
  "penName": "Eren Halverson",
  "genre": "dungeonTower",
  "hook": "The Tower appeared in 1964. In sixty years humanity had cleared thirty-eight floors. Floor Thirty-Nine was where our best Rank S-plus warriors had been dying for nineteen years. I was twenty-two, Rank F-minus (the lowest rank the Tower registered), and a part-time porter at the Guild Hall in Seattle. I entered the Tower because my sister's medical bills would otherwise take her from me. I awakened a hidden class on Floor One. I was the first Rank F on record to clear it solo. Floor Thirty-Nine was still seventy-seven stories above me.",
